   262	
   263	|  | Predicted: <class_1> | Predicted: <class_2> | ... |
   264	|--|---------------------|---------------------|-----|
   265	| Actual: <class_1> | <count> | <count> | ... |
   266	| Actual: <class_2> | <count> | <count> | ... |
   267	
   268	### Per-Class Metrics
   269	
   270	(Multiclass only.)
   271	
   272	| Class | Precision | Recall | F1 | Support |
   273	|-------|-----------|--------|----|---------|
   274	| <class> | <value> | <value> | <value> | <count> |
   275	
   276	### Confidence Intervals
   277	
   278	(Only present when bootstrap is enabled, i.e., --bootstrap > 0. One row per metric that has CI.)
   279	
   280	| Metric | Lower | Upper |
   281	|--------|-------|-------|
   282	| <metric> | <lower> | <upper> |
   283	
   284	(Repeat "## Split: ..." section for each split, in the order they appear in the manifest.)
   285	```
   286	
   287	**JSON report** (`report.json`):
   288	
   289	```json
   290	{
   291	  "model": {
   292	    "name": "<string>",
   293	    "version": "<string>",
   294	    "task_type": "<string>"
   295	  },
   296	  "splits": {
   297	    "<split_name>": {
   298	      "dataset": "<string>",
   299	      "metrics": {
   300	        "<metric_name>": <float>
   301	      },
   302	      "confusion_matrix": {
   303	        "classes": ["<class_1>", "<class_2>", ...],
   304	        "matrix": [[<int>, ...], ...]
   305	      },
   306	      "per_class_metrics": {
