   275	
   276	### Confidence Intervals
   277	
   278	(Only present when bootstrap is enabled, i.e., --bootstrap > 0. One row per metric that has CI.)
   279	
   280	| Metric | Lower | Upper |
   281	|--------|-------|-------|
   282	| <metric> | <lower> | <upper> |
   283	
   284	(Repeat "## Split: ..." section for each split, in the order they appear in the manifest.)
   285	```
