[32m[K301[m[K[36m[K:[m[K(Repeat "## Split: ..." section for each split, in the order they appear in the manifest. When [01;31m[K--split[m[K is used, only the selected splits appear.)
[32m[K342[m[K[36m[K:[m[KFields that don't apply to the task type (e.g., `confusion_matrix` for [01;31m[Kregression[m[K, `per_class_metrics` for binary) are omitted from the JSON output entirely (not set to null or empty).
[32m[K365[m[K[36m[K:[m[K## [01;31m[KRegression[m[K Analysis
